<li>Refreshes the user list after changes.</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<p><code>handleConfirmBan()</code></p>
<ul>
<li>Calls <code>authClient.admin.banUser()</code> with the user’s ID and the selected or entered ban reason.</li>
