</ul>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Row rendering</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Displays user details: <strong>Name, Email, Role, and Status (Active/Banned)</strong>.</li>
<li>Shows action buttons:<!-- -->
<ul>
