</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Ban modal</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Appears when banning a user.</li>
<li>Provides quick‑select ban reasons and a textarea for custom reasons.</li>
</ul>
</li>
