<p>Open <code>http://localhost:5173</code> in your browser.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>In a separate browser or incognito window, create some test user accounts by signing up.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>In the original browser window, log in with the account you assigned the <strong>admin</strong> role to in <a class="" href="#create-an-admin-user">Step 2</a>.</p>
